2026-11-07  Claude Code  <noreply at anthropic.com>

	* searchii.pl (calc_score_vgrate), rerankonly.pl (calc_score_vgrate):
	speed up.  Instead of building all substrings of each entry, count
	only those that also occur in the key, and stop extending from a
	position as soon as a substring is not in the key (no longer one
	can be).  The total number of substrings of the entry is
	len*(len+1)/2.  common_items now iterates over the smaller hash.
	Scores are unchanged; about 4x faster on typical title queries.

2026-11-06  Claude Code  <noreply at anthropic.com>

	* searchii.pl (get_contents): skip undefined lines.  When an ID in the
	index is missing from the entry file and sorts after its last line,
	look() hits EOF and readline() returns undef, which caused an
	"uninitialized value" warning.

